From christian-schneider's desktop-fixes branch (MusicTribeOpenSource/0716-AAF PR #8), the parts
this emulator needs: a macOS CHardwareTimer so the sequencer clock ticks (Play works), and the
non-throwing fs::space on macOS (the storage page aborted the app). _running is set before the
timer thread starts. The PR's idle-loop changes are covered by 0001; its JUCE text-input patch is
not needed with the headless screen of 0002.

